Alembic migrations for RAG Studio.

Generate a new revision (after editing models):

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

Apply all pending migrations:

    alembic upgrade head

Roll back one revision:

    alembic downgrade -1

The DB URL is read from app.config.Settings.database_url_sync at runtime,
so set DATABASE_URL in your .env (the alembic.ini sqlalchemy.url is only a
fallback / linting placeholder).
